    "long_instructions": "## Order a Pizza\r\n\r\n1. Plan: In `documentation.md`, decide:\r\n   - your function name\r\n   - what it does\r\n   - what inputs it takes  \r\n2. Write a function using your chosen name that takes in two parameters.\r\n\r\n3. Build a “Pizza Order” message using the parameters.\r\n\r\n4. Display the message on screen.\r\n\r\n5. Call your function inside the event listener so it runs when the button is clicked.\r\n\r\n_Challenge: Add another dropdown field to add an additional topping to the pizza_",
